<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-038" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards" source-id="s-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards-ws2273226">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards:p001:m0000" ref="ngw_hmv_7k0_AA">蕭景先</persName>，南蘭陵蘭陵人，太祖從子也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards:p001:m0018" ref="ngw_hmv_7k0">爰之</persName>，員外郎。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards:p001:m0026" ref="ngw_hmv_7k0_A">敬宗</persName>，始興王國中軍。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards:p002:m0000" ref="ngw_hmv_7k0_AA">景先</persName>本名<persName id="c-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards:p002:m0004" ref="ngw_hmv_7k0_AA">道先</persName>，乃改避上諱。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">轉中領軍。車駕射雉郊外行游，<persName id="c-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards:p003:m0014" ref="ngw_hmv_7k0_AA">景先</persName>常甲仗從，廉察左右。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards:p004:m0000" ref="dzw_yu2_gto_AA">蕭赤斧</persName>，南蘭陵人，太祖從祖弟也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards:p004:m0017" ref="dzw_yu2_gto">隆子</persName>，衞軍錄事參軍。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards:p004:m0028" ref="dzw_yu2_gto_A">始之</persName>，冠軍中兵參軍。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards:p005" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">世祖親遇與<persName id="c-nanqishu-038-ziliang-guards:p005:m0005" ref="ngw_hmv_7k0_AA">蕭景先</persName>相比。封南豐縣伯，邑四百戶。遷給事中，太子詹事。</p>
</text>
